B.a9j=s(["Encrypted groups: reasons, comments, photos and places are encrypted on the phones, the key is in the invite link.","With battery saver on, the graphics turn simple by themselves.","With the subscription, the limit of groups and places no longer says the subscription has more.","A web version for iPhone and computer: repuchat.com/app."],t.s)
